{"id":"proprium.dominica-ii-adventus-offertorium","title":"Deus, tu convérsus vivificábis nos","category":"proprium","section":"missa-fidelium","variant":"dominica-ii-adventus","sung":true,"st":"working-edition","ad":5,"adw":6,"about":{"pl":"Antyfona na ofiarowanie II Niedzieli Adwentu, z Psalmu 84. Te same wersety mówi kapłan u stopni ołtarza na początku każdej Mszy, gdzie są dialogiem między nim a usługującym. Tutaj tworzą jedną ciągłą prośbę.","en":"The offertory antiphon of the Second Sunday of Advent, from Psalm 84. The priest says the same verses at the foot of the altar at the beginning of every Mass, where they are a dialog between him and the server. Here they form one continuous petition."},"seg":[{"id":"s01","type":"verse","speaker":"schola","voice":"cantus","participation":{"lecta":{"gradus":4,"source":"DMS 31 d"},"cantu":{"gradus":3,"source":"DMS 25 c"}},"w":[{"i":"w001","f":"Deus","l":"deus","p":",","m":5},{"i":"w002","f":"tu","l":"tu","m":143},{"i":"w003","f":"convérsus","l":"converto","m":236,"h":"w002"},{"i":"w004","f":"vivificábis","l":"vivifico","m":252},{"i":"w005","f":"nos","l":"nos","p":",","m":49},{"i":"w006","f":"et","l":"et","m":15},{"i":"w007","f":"plebs","l":"plebs","m":20},{"i":"w008","f":"tua","l":"tuus","m":25,"h":"w007"},{"i":"w009","f":"lætábitur","l":"laetor","m":253},{"i":"w010","f":"in","l":"in","m":0,"h":"w011"},{"i":"w011","f":"te","l":"tu","p":":","m":131},{"i":"w012","f":"osténde","l":"ostendo","m":86},{"i":"w013","f":"nobis","l":"nos","p":",","m":53},{"i":"w014","f":"Dómine","l":"dominus","p":",","m":5},{"i":"w015","f":"misericórdiam","l":"misericordia","m":141},{"i":"w016","f":"tuam","l":"tuus","p":",","m":8,"h":"w015"},{"i":"w017","f":"et","l":"et","m":15},{"i":"w018","f":"salutáre","l":"salutare","m":136},{"i":"w019","f":"tuum","l":"tuus","m":137,"h":"w018"},{"i":"w020","f":"da","l":"do","m":41},{"i":"w021","f":"nobis","l":"nos","p":".","m":53}],"tr":{"pl":"Boże, Ty zwróciwszy się ożywisz nas, a lud Twój rozraduje się w Tob